# SHA-256 checksums for third-party scanner artifacts downloaded at run
# time (gitleaks, trivy, zizmor, bandit, ...). One line per release:
# "<digest>  <filename>" (sha256sum format). A mismatch means the
# artifact is not used.
#
# Before adding an entry, verify the artifact against its own project's
# published checksum/signature. Precede each entry with a comment linking
# to where it was downloaded from, so the digest is traceable back to its
# source. Remove entries no longer referenced.

# Original source: https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy/releases/download/v0.70.0/trivy_0.70.0_Linux-64bit.tar.gz
